. But the axe human was watched by balloon police because his sharp blade frightens balloon humans.While the axe man tried to get along with them, a balloon human got killed on the gloomy subway platform.<br><br>\n(Source: Young Power 2020)", "startDate": {"year": 2020, "month": null}, "endDate": {"year": 2020, "month": null}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 6, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": [], "tags": [{"name": "No Dialogue", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 120180, "title": {"romaji": "Ninja Collection", "english": "Ninja Collection"}, "format": "TV_SHORT", "description": "Tokyo: A city full of dreams and desires. Even today, there's a band of ninja passing down the old techniques and carrying out missions, hidden from the eyes of the public. Blending into the darkness of the city, slaying inhuman darkness... People call them the Tokeshu.<br><br>(Source: Crunchyroll)", "startDate": {"year": 2020, "month": 7}, "endDate": {"year": 2020, "month": 10}, "season": "SUMMER", "seasonYear": 2020, "episodes": 13, "duration": 5, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Horror"], "tags": [{"name": "Ninja", "rank": 92, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Episodic", "rank": 88, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Ghost", "rank": 80, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Denpa", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 120193, "title": {"romaji": "Yingxiong Zailin", "english": null}, "format": "ONA", "description": "A world where justice and evil collide. A dimension intertwined with magic and science. The retirement life of the strongest hero.\n<br><br>\n(Source: QQ, translated)", "startDate": {"year": 2020, "month": 10}, "endDate": {"year": 2020, "month": 12}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 12, "duration": 15, "countryOfOrigin": "CN", "source": "WEB_NOVEL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Action", "Fantasy", "Sci-Fi"], "tags": [{"name": "Superhero", "rank": 73, "isAdult":