ars in search of a new home, and just as this was going on, the moon's alignment caused massive earthquakes to ripple across the world, lasting several decades. Humanity was demolished. When the land finally recovered, humanity reemerged to face this strange yet familiar world. Will we, who once lorded over this domain, still remain the masters of this world?\n<br><br>\n(Source: BiliBili)", "startDate": {"year": 2020, "month": 7}, "endDate": {"year": 2020, "month": 10}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 6, "duration": 30, "countryOfOrigin": "CN", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": "灵笼:INCARNATION 下半季", "genres": ["Action", "Drama", "Horror", "Mecha", "Mystery", "Sci-Fi", "Thriller"], "tags": [{"name": "Dystopian", "rank": 100, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Post-Apocalyptic", "rank": 100, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Tragedy", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Kaiju", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Lost Civilization", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Gore", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Full CGI", "rank": 75, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Guns", "rank": 70, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Male Protagonist", "rank": 70, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Military", "rank": 66, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Robots", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Chimera", "rank": 40, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 120315, "title": {"romaji": "Dappys", "english": null}, "format": "TV_SHORT", "description": "Love trouble, friendship, busy work.When the mind is tight and painful, you ought to shed it! Very cute \"Dappys\" sing and dance to give encouragement.", "startDate": {"year": 2017, "month": 5}, "endDate": {"year": 2020, "month": 4}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 3, "duration": 1, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Music"], "tags": [{"name": "Nudity", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Body Horror", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Slavery", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Bullying", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Slapstick", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 120320, "title": {"romaji": "Yuan Long", "english": "Carp Reborn"}, "format": "ONA", "description": "Special forces operative Wang Sheng was transported into the world of Yuanhun (Origin Spirits). There, he was possessed by a useless spirit: a carp, becoming an infamous trash in the world of Origin Spirits! <br>\n<br>\nIn this world filled with experts, Wang Sheng used the knowledges he acquires to surmount all difficulties, even finding a way to evolve his useless spirit carp! From a sparrow to a Phoenix, from a carp to a Dragon! In this sinister and vicious world full of disputes, he will make his own path towards success! <br>\n<br>\nLegends says that a carp who leaps over the the Dragon’s gate will become a dragon itself. Through effort and courage, even an insignificant carp can defy its own fate and become a legend. <br>\n<br>\n(Source: Chinese Publisher, translated)", "startDate": {"year": 2020, "month": 7}, "endDate": {"year": 2020, "month": 10}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 16, "duration": 18, "countryOfOrigin": "CN", "source": "WEB_NOVEL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Fantasy"], "tags": [{"name": "Anti-Hero", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Guns", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Male Protagonist", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Military", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Wuxia", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Magic", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Cultivation", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Isekai", "rank": 50, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Full CGI", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Archery", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 120324, "title": {"romaji": "Bai Gui Youeryuan 3", "english": null}, "format": "ONA", "description": "Third season of <i>Bai Gui Youeryuan</i>.", "startDate": {"year": 2020, "month": 5}, "endDate": {"year": 2020, "month": 8}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 12, "duration": 5, "countryOfOrigin": "CN", "source": "DOUJINSHI", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Comedy"], "tags": [{"name": "Chibi", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 120326, "title": {"romaji": "Fengyu Lang Qiao", "english": null}, "format": "ONA", "description": null, "startDate": {"year": 2020, "month": 6}, "endDate": {"year": 2020, "month": 6}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 22, "countryOfOrigin": "CN", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Action", "Drama"], "tags": [{"name": "Stop Motion", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "No Dialogue", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 120339, "title": {"romaji": "Shisouhan", "english": "Thought Crime"}, "format": "MUSIC", "description": "Music video directed and animated by Rabbit MACHINE for the song <i>Thoughtcrime</i> by Yorushika.<br></br>\n\nThe theme of thoughtcrime is plagiarized from George Orwell's novel, \"1984.\" Then, the moment it was declared that it's plagiarized, the plagiarized work changed form into a homage. The line between doing plagiarism and doing a homage seems ambiguous, and the truth is that that line doesn't exist anywhere. It holds true even when the role is reversed. A homage holds a great risk of becoming plagiarism.<br></br>\n\nThe lyrics to this song pays homage to Ozaki Hosai's haiku and his final years of life.<br></br>", "startDate": {"year": 2020, "month": 6}, "endDate": {"year": 2020, "month": 6}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 4, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Psychological"], "tags": []}, {"id": 120404, "title": {"romaji": "Jingzhong Baoguo", "english": null}, "format": "ONA", "description": "Three teenagers, one dream: serving their country with all they have. The three young men serving in the sea, land and air are inspired by the traditional Chinese culture of \"serving the country with loyalty\", fighting together and growing together, fighting for the strong country and the strong army, and protecting peace and happiness!", "startDate": {"year": 2020, "month": 9}, "endDate": {"year": 2020, "month": 9}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 18, "countryOfOrigin": "CN", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Action"], "tags": [{"name": "Military", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 120405, "title": {"romaji": "Xin Jue", "english": null}, "format": "ONA", "description": "The power of beginnings, the energy of the core stone; one may find it good, one may find it evil. During a normal investigation, Yue Juntian finds himself drawn into the battle between the 'beginnings' of Yun City; Jiang Xin arrives in Yun City to stop Li Zunyuan's plan to take over. The two influence each other - one solves the mystery of their birth, the other redeems themselves. Together, they oppose Li Zunyuan.", "startDate": {"year": 2020, "month": 10}, "endDate": {"year": 2020, "month": 12}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 13, "duration": null, "countryOfOrigin": "CN", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": "#芯觉", "genres": ["Action", "Fantasy", "Sci-Fi"], "tags": [{"name": "Magic", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Full CGI", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Cyberpunk", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 120419, "title": {"romaji": "Renlei Bowuguan", "english": "Museum of Humanity"}, "format": "ONA", "description": "After the end of the world, there is a mysterious museum left in the world. No one knows where the collection came from. Are these seemingly funny \"historical relics\" proof of the existence of real humans?\n<br><br>\n(Source: bilibili, translated)", "startDate": {"year": 2020, "month": 8}, "endDate": {"year": 2020, "month": 11}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 36, "duration": 1, "countryOfOrigin": "CN", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Comedy"], "tags": [{"name